OL,3,GNEWSAArtists angry as theatre cuts
OL,4,Astaff and shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community theatre is cutting down on
OL,7,Foriginal productions, including its
OL,8,FChristmas show, and has let go of key
OL,9,Fstaff members.
OL,11,FLocal freelance artists and creatives
OL,12,Fexpressed anger at not being consulted
OL,13,Fabout the changes at The Point Theatre
OL,14,Fin Eastleigh, which one composer called
OL,15,Fa "mind-bogglingly bad decision".
OL,17,FThe venue's artistic director and
OL,18,Ftheatre programmer were both made
OL,19,Fredundant following an internal staff
OL,20,Fconsultation, which ran from July to
OL,21,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
